WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.083
Today we will use art to communicate a helpful message. Our work connects with

00:00:05.083 --> 00:00:07.176
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:13.271
Choose one clear message about a community need. Name a design choice that a selected

00:00:13.271 --> 00:00:14.668
Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.008
Draw a bold image that supports the message.

00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:22.520
Add a few large readable words and check the layout.
